  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/electricity-craftsman#">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전기기능사 온톨로지</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Electricity Craftsman Qualification Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">큐넷의 전기기능사 시험 정보와 출처·적용기간을 연결하는 초안이다. 상세 학습 기준은 버전별 검토 상태와 함께 관리한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A draft connecting Q-Net electricity-craftsman exam facts to provenance and validity periods. Detailed learning criteria are managed with explicit version and review status.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:versionInfo>0.1.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </rdf:Description>
